<title>SPAIN: Spain 10-yr March bond futures dive.</title>
<headline>Spain 10-yr March bond futures dive.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's 10-year March bond future fell more than two points on Friday, following the Italian bond lower amid renewed jitters about the single currency project.</p>
<p>The March bono fell to a low of 111.61, and at 1615 GMT was trading down 2.09 points at 111.70.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
